{"Title":"An Act authorizing the town of Dracut to adopt alternative methods for notice of public hearings","BillNumber":"H4430","DocketNumber":"HD4688","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"CMG1","Name":"Colleen M. Garry","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CMG1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-31T13:53:01.417"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"CMG1","Name":"Colleen M. Garry","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CMG1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-31T13:53:01.4166667"},{"Id":"EDJ0","Name":"Edward J. Kennedy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/EDJ0","ResponseDate":"2023-11-14T11:49:41.9166667"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"EDJ0","Name":"Edward J. Kennedy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/EDJ0","ResponseDate":"2023-10-31T13:53:01.417"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4430/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Garry of Dracut and Senator Kennedy, a joint petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 4430) of Colleen M. Garry and Edward J. Kennedy (by vote of the town) that the town of Dracut be authorized to adopt alternative methods for notice of public hearings.  Municipalities and Regional Government.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding section 11 of chapter 40A of the General Laws, or any general or special law to the contrary, the Town of Dracut may adopt and further amend general by-laws that regulate the publishing of legal notices of public hearings on the official website operated by the town.\r\n\tSECTION 2. The town may allow all legal notices of public hearings to be published: (i) in a local newspaper, either in electronic or paper format; or (ii) on the bulletin outside the town clerk's office; and (iii) on the town's website.\r\n\tSECTION 3. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J10","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}